<!-- ============================================================
  SCHOOLFLASHCARDS5 — sfc-migrate-games.html
  ONE-TIME USE TOOL. Uploads the 45 games that used to be hardcoded
  in the games page into Firestore (site/sfc-games), so you don't
  have to re-type them all into sfc-admin.html by hand.

  Two games in the original list used RELATIVE image paths
  (fnaf4halloween.jpg and deltarune-heroes-blue-fire-....jpg) rather
  than full URLs — those were imported as-is, so they'll only show
  correctly if those image files are deployed alongside your site.
  Fix them in sfc-admin.html (search/paste a real URL) if needed.

  HOW TO USE:
    1. Make sure Firestore + Authentication + an admin user are set
       up in the Firebase console (same steps as for PinkGame).
    2. Open this page and log in.
    3. Click "Import 45 Games". Wait for it to finish.
    4. Open sfc-admin.html to confirm the games are there.
    5. Delete this file — running it twice would duplicate everything
       (it warns you first).
============================================================ -->

<title>SchoolFlashCards5 — Migrate Games (one-time)</title>
<style>
:root { --primary:#4ECDC4; --accent:#FFE66D; --dark:#292F36; --light:#F7FFF7; --button:#FF6B6B; }
* { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; font-family:"Comic Sans MS", cursive, sans-serif; }
body { background: var(--light); color: var(--dark); min-height:100vh; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
.box { max-width:460px; width:100%; background:white; border-radius:12px; padding:32px; margin:20px; box-shadow:0 3px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
h1 { font-size:20px; color:var(--dark); margin-bottom:8px; }
p { color:#777; font-size:14px; margin-bottom:18px; line-height:1.5; }
.field { margin-bottom:12px; }
.field label { display:block; font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:var(--dark); margin-bottom:5px; }
.field input { width:100%; border:2px solid #e2e2e2; color:var(--dark); font-family:inherit; font-size:15px; padding:9px 12px; border-radius:8px; outline:none; }
.field input:focus { border-color:var(--primary); }
button { background:var(--button); border:none; color:white; font-family:inherit; font-weight:bold; font-size:15px; padding:11px 20px; border-radius:8px; cursor:pointer; width:100%; }
button:disabled { opacity:0.5; cursor:not-allowed; }
.status { margin-top:16px; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; white-space:pre-line; line-height:1.6; }
.status.ok { color:#1a8a4a; }
.status.err { color:#d64545; }
.status.warn { color:#c98a00; }
#importPanel { display:none; }
.error-box { background:#ffe3e3; border:1px solid #ffb3b3; color:#a11; font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; padding:9px 12px; border-radius:8px; margin-bottom:14px; display:none; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="box">

  <div id="loginPanel">
    <h1>Admin Login Required</h1>
    <p>Sign in with your admin account to run the import.</p>
    <div class="error-box" id="loginError"></div>
    <div class="field"><label>Email</label><input type="email" id="loginEmail"/></div>
    <div class="field"><label>Password</label><input type="password" id="loginPassword"/></div>
    <button id="loginBtn">Sign In</button>
  </div>

  <div id="importPanel">
    <h1>Import 45 Games</h1>
    <p>Uploads the original SchoolFlashCards5 lineup into Firestore. Safe to run once — it checks for existing games first and asks before creating duplicates.</p>
    <button id="importBtn">Import 45 Games</button>
    <div class="status" id="status"></div>
  </div>

</div>

